@startuml PresentationLayerSequence

actor User
participant "EchoClient2 (GUI)" as EchoClient2
participant "EchoServer3 (Console)" as EchoServer3

User -> EchoClient2: Clicks "Login" button
EchoClient2 -> User: Displays "Connected to SMP Server with SSL"
EchoClient2 -> EchoServer3: LOGIN t00224519 mypassword
EchoServer3 -> EchoClient2: 101 LOGIN SUCCESS
EchoServer3 -> EchoServer3: Logs "New client connected via SSL"
EchoClient2 -> User: Displays "101 LOGIN SUCCESS"
EchoClient2 -> User: Enables action buttons

User -> EchoClient2: Enters "Hello!" and clicks "Upload"
EchoClient2 -> EchoServer3: UPLOAD Hello!
EchoServer3 -> EchoClient2: 201 UPLOAD SUCCESS (Message ID: d0)
EchoServer3 -> EchoServer3: Logs "Message received from client: d0, Hello!"
EchoClient2 -> User: Displays "201 UPLOAD SUCCESS (Message ID: d0)"

User -> EchoClient2: Clicks "Download"
EchoClient2 -> EchoServer3: DOWNLOAD
EchoServer3 -> EchoClient2: 301 MESSAGE (ID: d0): Hello!
EchoServer3 -> EchoClient2: Message Downloaded
EchoClient2 -> User: Displays messages

User -> EchoClient2: Clicks "Logoff"
EchoClient2 -> EchoServer3: LOGOFF
EchoServer3 -> EchoClient2: 401 LOGOFF SUCCESS
EchoServer3 -> EchoServer3: Logs "Client has logged off"
EchoClient2 -> User: Displays "401 LOGOFF SUCCESS"
EchoClient2 -> User: Disables action buttons

@enduml